#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.122.0 — HR 2: Recruitment & Onboarding (pass 2 of 8).

Hiring as a pipeline: the job opening born from the structure, the
applicant pool, structured interviews and assessment, the offer from
the grade, pre-joining verification, the onboarding checklist, and
probation as a governed trial. Manual depth from birth: 9 chapters,
35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_hr_pro.seed_hr_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.121.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

